window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-a5891ee80412feff"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"prioritize-accounts\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">为客户账户排定优先级</h1> <p>按风险、增长空间、紧迫性和下一步行动排列账户。</p> <p>向 ChatGPT 提供账户记录、客户对话、使用情况信号、续约或增长背景和审查规则，然后请它生成一份排序后的账户简报，说明排序依据、风险、下一步行动、来源链接和过时信息。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>需要规划哪些账户最值得优先跟进的客户经理和销售团队。</li> <li>需要结合 CRM（客户关系管理系统）、对话、使用情况和账户计划的续约、扩展或销售管道审查。</li> <li>希望下一步行动有来源依据，而不只是看到一个缺乏解释的分数的团队。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>检查账户数据导出、评分字段，以及使用情况或销售管道信号。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>阅读账户计划、续约记录和获准使用的客户背景资料。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack（需联网）</a></td> <td>在获准使用的讨论串中查找近期交易、续约或账户背景。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/gmail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gmail（需联网）</a></td> <td>如果客户邮件属于本次审查记录的一部分，则查看相关邮件背景。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>为本周的账户排定优先级</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">我正在为 [renewal, growth, or pipeline] 相关账户（续约、增长或销售管道）规划本周工作。\n\n请使用我提供的账户数据导出、近期通话记录、未关闭的客户邮件讨论串、使用情况仪表盘、账户计划和审查规则，为我排出最应优先关注的 [number] 个账户。\n\n每个账户请说明：\n- 为什么现在值得关注\n- 主要风险或增长空间\n- 建议采取的下一步行动\n- 来源链接\n- 过时或缺失的背景信息\n\n只有在下一步明确时才起草跟进说明。不要更新 CRM 记录，也不要联系客户。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/how-to-use-codex-for-everyday-work/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy：日常工作（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"bring-the-signals-together\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">汇总各种信号</h2> <p>如果能解释某个账户为何此刻重要，优先级排序才真正有用。向 ChatGPT 提供账户列表、近期对话、使用情况或续约信号、计划和审查规则，然后让它生成有依据的排序简报，而不是只给一个无法解释的分数。</p> <ol> <li>定义账户范围、时间窗口和优先级标准。</li> <li>附上或指出 CRM 数据导出、通话、邮件、使用情况仪表盘、计划和审查规则。</li> <li>运行起始提示词，要求逐个账户说明理由、来源、过时背景和下一步行动。</li> <li>使用任何客户跟进建议前，先审阅相关内容。</li> <li>将获准的行动手动交给记录系统，或通过另行审查过的工作流执行。</li> </ol> <p>把风险、增长空间、紧迫性和缺失背景分成独立字段并清楚呈现。这样可以避免一个总体排名掩盖账户负责人作出判断所需的证据。</p> <p><a id=\"tune-the-priority-list\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">调整优先级列表</h2> <p>第一版排序有帮助后，可以更换审查规则进行比较，例如续约日期、扩展潜力、活动间隔或客户风险。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Re-rank the account list using [priority rule].\n\nCompare it with the original ranking and show:\n\n- accounts that moved the most\n- the source signals behind each move\n- accounts with stale or missing context\n- actions that remain the same across both rankings\n- follow-up drafts that still need owner review\n\nDo not update CRM records or contact customers.\n</code></pre> <blockquote> <p><strong>中文释义：</strong> 请按 [priority rule]（优先级规则）重新排列账户列表，并与原排序进行比较：列出排名变化最大的账户、导致各账户排名变化的来源信号、背景信息已过时或缺失的账户、两次排序中保持不变的行动，以及仍需账户负责人审阅的跟进草稿。不要更新 CRM 记录，也不要联系客户。代码块保留官方英文提示词，便于对照原始模板。</p> </blockquote>","en":"<h1 id=\"prioritize-accounts\">Prioritize accounts</h1> <p>Rank accounts by risk, upside, urgency, and next action.</p> <p>Give ChatGPT account records, customer conversations, usage signals, renewal or growth context, and review rules, then ask it to produce a ranked account brief with rationale, risks, next actions, source links, and follow-up drafts.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Account managers and sales teams planning which accounts deserve attention first.</li> <li>Renewal, expansion, or pipeline reviews that combine CRM, conversations, usage, and account plans.</li> <li>Teams that want next actions grounded in sources rather than a score with no explanation.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Inspect account exports, score fields, and usage or pipeline signals.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Read account plans, renewal notes, and approved customer context.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack (online)</a></td> <td>Find recent deal, renewal, or account context in approved threads.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/gmail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gmail (online)</a></td> <td>Check customer email context when it is part of the review record.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Rank my accounts for the week</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">I'm planning my week for [renewal, growth, or pipeline] accounts.\n\nUse the account export, recent call transcripts, open customer email threads, usage dashboard, account plans, and the review rules I provide. Rank the [number] accounts I should focus on first.\n\nFor each account, include:\n- why it matters now\n- the main risk or upside\n- the recommended next action\n- source links\n- stale or missing context\n\nDraft follow-up notes only where the next step is clear. Do not update CRM records or contact customers.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/how-to-use-codex-for-everyday-work/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy: Everyday work (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Plugins</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"bring-the-signals-together\">Bring the signals together</h2> <p>Account priority is more useful when it explains why an account matters now. Give ChatGPT the account list, recent conversations, usage or renewal signals, plans, and review rules, then ask for a ranked brief rather than an unexplained score.</p> <ol> <li>Define the account segment, time window, and priority criteria.</li> <li>Attach or name the CRM export, calls, emails, usage dashboard, plans, and review rules.</li> <li>Run the starter prompt and ask for rationale, sources, stale context, and next actions per account.</li> <li>Review any recommended customer follow-up before using it.</li> <li>Hand approved actions to the system of record manually or through a separately reviewed workflow.</li> </ol> <p>Keep risk, upside, urgency, and missing context visible as separate fields. This prevents a high-level ranking from hiding the evidence an account owner needs to make a judgment.</p> <h2 id=\"tune-the-priority-list\">Tune the priority list</h2> <p>Once the first ranking is useful, test how it changes under a different review rule, such as renewal date, expansion potential, activity gap, or customer risk.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Re-rank the account list using [priority rule].\n\nCompare it with the original ranking and show:\n\n- accounts that moved the most\n- the source signals behind each move\n- accounts with stale or missing context\n- actions that remain the same across both rankings\n- follow-up drafts that still need owner review\n\nDo not update CRM records or contact customers.\n</code></pre>"};
